{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Galaxy is a thrilling singleplayer space shooter that blends weird fiction, dark gritty sci-fi, and transhumanism fiction atmospheres into a unique gaming experience.<br>Take control of a raider, an ex-convict turned bio-ship hybrid, and find your place in the dangerous Galaxy of Neterun, where you have been exiled for the eternity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Your Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accused of murder and stripped of your human body, you awaken as a raider with no memory of your past life. Exiled forever to the dangerous Galaxy of Neterun, your mind is trapped in a metal shell. Will you rise above rival raiders and uncover the secrets hidden in ancient Neterunian ruins?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forget Your Humanity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flesh and bone are gone. Your survival depends on a fully customizable ship.<br>Gather resources and install modules starting from your cockpit to reshape yourself into an ever-deadlier raider. Experiment with countless combinations and adapt to the dangers of exile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/39200904a17400894e7b26c3cac9f274.poster.avif?t=1770377678\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/39200904a17400894e7b26c3cac9f274.webm?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/39200904a17400894e7b26c3cac9f274.mp4?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into Neterun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually stunning galaxy rich with forgotten lore, shadowy ruins, and hostile creatures that threaten both body and mind. Encounter rival raiders and uncover the stories of other exiles in a world where humanity is only a distant memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/e48edc2d76cf846a40e5e1ee42e8d34c.poster.avif?t=1770377678\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/e48edc2d76cf846a40e5e1ee42e8d34c.webm?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/e48edc2d76cf846a40e5e1ee42e8d34c.mp4?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill or Be Killed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face every dogfight as if it were your last, where your chosen configuration can mean the difference between life and death. Shift your mental focus to a balanced, aggressive, or defensive setup, and adapt quickly to different enemies. Defend not just the integrity of your hull, but also the stability of your mind against the ghostly creatures of Neterun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/4a6917091450a90847efde5a313e7be2.poster.avif?t=1770377678\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/4a6917091450a90847efde5a313e7be2.webm?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/4a6917091450a90847efde5a313e7be2.mp4?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2513490?t=1770377678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2513490?t=1770377678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770377678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770377678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/0ff6a605f3ca849e89c646b1192572d0.avif?t=1770377678\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras_big/0ff6a605f3ca849e89c646b1192572d0.avif?t=1770377678 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Blend of Genres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative Combat Mechanic</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Galaxy is a thrilling singleplayer space shooter that blends weird fiction, dark gritty sci-fi, and transhumanism fiction atmospheres into a unique gaming experience.<br>Take control of a raider, an ex-convict turned bio-ship hybrid, and find your place in the dangerous Galaxy of Neterun, where you have been exiled for the eternity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Your Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accused of murder and stripped of your human body, you awaken as a raider with no memory of your past life. Exiled forever to the dangerous Galaxy of Neterun, your mind is trapped in a metal shell. Will you rise above rival raiders and uncover the secrets hidden in ancient Neterunian ruins?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forget Your Humanity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flesh and bone are gone. Your survival depends on a fully customizable ship.<br>Gather resources and install modules starting from your cockpit to reshape yourself into an ever-deadlier raider. Experiment with countless combinations and adapt to the dangers of exile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/39200904a17400894e7b26c3cac9f274.poster.avif?t=1770377678\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/39200904a17400894e7b26c3cac9f274.webm?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/39200904a17400894e7b26c3cac9f274.mp4?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into Neterun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually stunning galaxy rich with forgotten lore, shadowy ruins, and hostile creatures that threaten both body and mind. Encounter rival raiders and uncover the stories of other exiles in a world where humanity is only a distant memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/e48edc2d76cf846a40e5e1ee42e8d34c.poster.avif?t=1770377678\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513490/extras/e48edc2d76cf846a40e5e1ee42e8d34c.webm?t=1770377678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https